   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Still in the Claude Monet storeroom, Nastya has second thoughts. Using Kostya to get back at Max feels wrong, and she tells him so. Kostya is far too kind to take offence, and he has an idea of his own. Listen in Russian first.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
